{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"Yeah I talked to him and he is all for staying and seeing what happens, love itttt","created_at":"2021-07-16T16:47:14.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865635702619111425","reply_to_id":"865319479049977876","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"I slept through my alarms this morning so uh... Good morning but actually afternoon O.O\n\nHere's some stuff I wanted to bring up. We don't have to talk about it now, I just don't want to forget 😅\n\nIn addition to the stuff already said in the announcement, I was wondering if we should just be candid with players and let them know if an event has to go a certain way. It might ruin some of the surprise but it at least reassures players that this fight is \"unwinnable\" on purpose and that we have a plan. I have to admit I'm not a big fan of fights having set outcomes, but I understand that sometimes that needs to be done to advance the plot in a certain direction. I think most players would be willing to give it their all and loose if they new it would be meaningful in the end.\n\nIt was also mentioned to me that the last couple fights has been unbalanced. I haven't been able to participate in many of them so I don't have personal experience with this, but I've noticed that we have had lots of player deaths. I understand that we have a mechanic this year to bring them back, but it's only week one and I would hate for death to just become a nuisance and loose it's meaning. I'm not a DM and don't know a lot about balancing combat, but hopefully this isn't something that is too hard to address?\n\nOverall it seems that players are having a good time, it just looks like we have some minor things to address about combats/events that can help us going forward ^-^","created_at":"2021-07-16T20:15:59.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865688235732893726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
