{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"I wasn't calling out any specific fight, I was just passing on what I'd been told. I will say, the two groups in the sewers were run very differently. I have no idea if even one of those was \"correct\", at this point it doesn't matter. I just want to figure out if there is something that we should be doing differently and what we should do going forward.","created_at":"2021-07-16T20:51:26.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865697159545618452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
