{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"I don't think it's fair to expect the players to play optimally with their money and gear, or to optimally play combat. If players aren't having fun with how the events are balanced that means we need to shift our and their expectations to be better in line. I think it's fully valid to be upset that a lot of the work we put in isn't panning out the way we wanted, but I don't think it's fair to say that they aren't showing their thanks. They're coming back and willing to stick with it even after an event they might not have enjoyed. I think that shows a lot of faith in us and appreciation. \n\nAs for the vets being the ones with complaints, I think that means that maybe we didn't do a good enough job communicating the ways this season would be different from the previous. That's all I'm going to say on this, I've gotta smooth out my prep for tonight. I appreciate all of you very much and I know we'll figure it how to make things better, whatever that looks like.","created_at":"2021-07-16T20:56:18.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865698384366534676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
